      "title": "Mother and daughter killed in grizzly bear attack, Canadian authorities confirm",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/nov/04/canada-bear-attack-mother-daughter-killed",
      "description": "<p>Conservation officers say more than one bear may have been involved in attack on women near their home</p><p>Search teams in <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/canada\">Canada</a> have discovered the body of a 20-year-old woman and confirmed that both she and her mother were killed in an attack that conservation officers now believe could have involved multiple grizzly bears.</p><p>Late on Tuesday, conservation officers in British Columbia said the two women, who were reported missing over the weekend, were located near a trail a short distance from their home.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/nov/04/canada-bear-attack-mother-daughter-killed\">Continue reading...</a>",
